---

Model: AdaFace IR-101, trained on WebFace4M
Paper: "AdaFace: Quality Adaptive Margin for Face Recognition" (Kim et al., CVPR 2022), arXiv:2204.00964
Source: https://huggingface.co/minchul/cvlface_adaface_ir101_webface4m
Weights (model.safetensors) downloaded as-is; the IResNet-100 architecture and
ONNX export in this repo were written independently from the tensor names/
shapes in the checkpoint (no code from the source repo is used).
